# A game named beyond Latin-1, launched and back, in English with save states
# on: the launch reads the name through FatFs as it is; the in-game menu
# (ingame.c) has no script glyphs and folds the name's letters to Latin-1;
# Back to Torii restarts the kernel, whose question about the game's save names
# its folder under /torii/saves with the kernel's own glyphs (font_extra.c),
# and Recent lists the game.
#! settings 2=1
#! sd-put "/Łódź Ελλάδα Москва ★.gba" tests/roms/hello/hello.gba
-w "nav: home ready"
-P "@8:nav_test_path:/Łódź Ελλάδα Москва ★.gba" -p @8:nav_test_action:0x7E000002
-w "launch: starting the game"
-k @300:L+R+START -k @306:-
-w "screen ready: ingame"
-s @1:ingame.png
-k @40:UP -k @44:- -k @52:A -k @56:-
-w "Torii kernel boot"
-w "screen ready: dialog"
-s @4:dialog.png
-k @8:A -k @12:-
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:A -k @12:-
-w "nav: page recent ready"
-s @2:recent.png
